<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>NASA Procurement Intelligence Dashboard</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no">
<script>
// Resolve theme (saved choice, else system preference) before first paint,
// so switching or reloading never flashes the wrong theme.
(function () {
  var saved = null;
  try { saved = localStorage.getItem("nasa_dashboard_theme"); } catch (e) {}
  var theme = saved || (window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)").matches ? "dark" : "light");
  document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme", theme);
})();
</script>
<style>
:root {
  /* Mission-control theme, bright variant: same technical language (crisp
     panels, glow-accented readouts, uppercase mono labels) as the dark
     version, but on a light background instead -- everything below still
     themes purely via these var(--...) values. Only the header stays dark,
     as a deliberate "instrument panel" accent bar; see its own rules. */
  --navy: #0f1e33;         /* primary heading/dark text */
  --navy-2: #3d5a75;       /* secondary readable text */
  --blue: #0891b2;         /* primary accent -- bold technical teal */
  --red: #dc2626;          /* danger / deobligation */
  --bg: #eef2f7;           /* page background, light blue-grey */
  --panel: #ffffff;        /* panel background */
  --panel-2: #f1f5f9;      /* secondary panel accent (table headers etc) */
  --border: #cbd5e1;       /* panel/table borders */
  --text: #0f1e33;         /* primary body text */
  --text-muted: #64748b;   /* muted labels/secondary text */
  --ok: #059669;           /* green: positive / success */
  --warn: #d97706;         /* amber: warning / growth flags */
  --nasa-blue: #0891b2;
  --nasa-red: #e8482c;
  --glow-blue: 0 0 6px rgba(8,145,178,0.3);
  --glow-green: 0 0 6px rgba(5,150,105,0.3);
  --glow-red: 0 0 6px rgba(220,38,38,0.3);
}
/* Dark variant, toggled via the header's theme button. Values match the
   earlier all-dark build; kept here so a viewer's preference decides,
   rather than us deciding once for everyone. Resolved and applied before
   first paint by the inline script in <head> so there's no flash. */
:root[data-theme="dark"] {
  --navy: #eaf2ff; --navy-2: #9fb4d6; --blue: #22d3ee; --red: #ff4d5e;
  --bg: #05070c; --panel: #0b1220; --panel-2: #0e1626; --border: #1c2b42;
  --text: #dbe6f5; --text-muted: #6b7d9c; --ok: #2bffa0; --warn: #ffb020;
  --nasa-blue: #22d3ee; --nasa-red: #ff5b3d;
  --glow-blue: 0 0 10px rgba(34,211,238,0.35);
  --glow-green: 0 0 10px rgba(43,255,160,0.3);
  --glow-red: 0 0 10px rgba(255,77,94,0.3);
}
:root[data-theme="dark"] body {
  background:
    linear-gradient(rgba(34,211,238,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(34,211,238,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% -10%, rgba(34,211,238,0.09), transparent 60%),
    var(--bg);
  background-size: 34px 34px, 34px 34px, 100% 100%, 100% 100%;
}
:root[data-theme="dark"] nav.tabs { box-shadow: none; }
:root[data-theme="dark"] table.data-table th.sortable:hover { background: #142338; }
:root[data-theme="dark"] table.data-table td { border-bottom-color: #131d2e; }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .controls select, :root[data-theme="dark"] .controls input { background: #0e1728; }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .controls button.secondary { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .chip { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .sc-actions button { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .sc-actions button:hover { filter: brightness(1.25); }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .panel, :root[data-theme="dark"] .standout-card { box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); }
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scrollbar-color: var(--border) var(--bg); }
::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 10px; height: 10px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg); }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border); border-radius: 5px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--blue); }
body {
  margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  background:
    linear-gradient(rgba(8,145,178,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8,145,178,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
    var(--bg);
  background-size: 34px 34px, 34px 34px, 100% 100%;
  color: var(--text); font-size: 14px;
}
header.top {
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 12% 22%, rgba(34,211,238,0.10) 0, transparent 1.4px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 78% 55%, rgba(34,211,238,0.08) 0, transparent 1.2px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 45% 80%, rgba(34,211,238,0.07) 0, transparent 1.1px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 92% 15%, rgba(34,211,238,0.09) 0, transparent 1.3px),
    linear-gradient(120deg, #060a14, #0a1424);
  background-size: 140px 140px, 160px 160px, 130px 130px, 150px 150px, 100% 100%;
  color: #fff; padding: 18px 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.35);
  box-shadow: 0 1px 24px rgba(34,211,238,0.12);
}
.header-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
.nasa-mark { flex: 0 0 auto; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(34,211,238,0.55)); }
.header-title-block { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
.header-title-block .title-line { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
header.top h1 {
  margin: 0; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #f2f8ff; text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(34,211,238,0.45);
}
.nasa-wordmark {
  font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 15px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--nasa-red), #ffb27a);
  -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
}
.unofficial-badge {
  display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: #ffcf9e; border: 1px solid rgba(255,207,158,0.5);
  border-radius: 3px; padding: 1px 8px; margin-left: 2px;
}
header.top .disclosure { font-size: 12px; color: #7fa8c4; margin: 6px 0 10px 0; }
/* Single horizontal row -- scrolls instead of wrapping to multiple lines,
   so the header stays compact on narrow/mobile viewports. */
.meta-bar {
  display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; overflow-x: auto; gap: 10px; font-size: 11px;
  color: #7fa8c4; font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Consolas, monospace;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
}
/* Header stays dark deliberately (instrument-panel accent bar), so its own
   accent color is fixed bright cyan rather than following --blue, which is
   tuned for readability on the light body below. */
.meta-bar b { color: #22d3ee; text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(34,211,238,0.4); }
.meta-bar .badge {
  background: rgba(34,211,238,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.25);
  border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 7px; white-space: nowrap; flex: 0 0 auto;
}
/* Narrow viewports: let the header buttons/timeframe control wrap onto
   their own row under the title instead of squeezing the title block (and
   therefore the meta-bar) down to a sliver. */
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  header.top { padding: 14px 16px; }
  .header-row { flex-wrap: wrap; row-gap: 10px; }
  .header-row > div:last-child { width: 100%; justify-content: flex-start; }
}
nav.tabs {
  display: flex; background: var(--panel); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 0 20px; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; overflow-x: auto;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,30,51,0.04);
}
nav.tabs button {
  background: none; border: none; padding: 13px 18px; font-size: 12.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6px; border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
  cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-muted); border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
  white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 700; transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
}
nav.tabs button.active { color: var(--blue); border-bottom-color: var(--blue); text-shadow: var(--glow-blue); background: rgba(34,211,238,0.07); }
nav.tabs button:hover { color: var(--navy); background: rgba(34,211,238,0.04); }
main { padding: 16px 24px 40px; max-width: 1880px; margin: 0 auto; }
.grid-2-even { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: start; }
@media (max-width: 1100px) { .grid-2-even { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.tab-panel { display: none; }
.tab-panel.active { display: block; }
.warning-banner {
  background: rgba(255,176,32,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,176,32,0.4); color: #ffcf7d;
  padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12.5px; margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.kpi-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 13px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.kpi {
  background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 13px 15px; position: relative; border-top: 2px solid var(--blue);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(15,30,51,0.05); transition: box-shadow 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
}
.kpi .label { font-size: 10.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 6px; }
.kpi .value {
  font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Consolas, monospace; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--blue); text-shadow: var(--glow-blue);
}
.kpi .value.neg { color: var(--red); text-shadow: var(--glow-red); }
.kpi.clickable { cursor: pointer; padding-right: 26px; }
.kpi.clickable::after {
  content: "⋯ how?"; position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 12px; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.7;
}
.kpi.clickable:hover, .kpi.clickable:focus-visible {
  border-color: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(8,145,178,0.16); transform: translateY(-1px);
}
.kpi.clickable:hover::after, .kpi.clickable:focus-visible::after { opacity: 1; color: var(--blue); }
.panel {
  background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 9px;
  padding: 17px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-shadow: 0 3px 14px rgba(15,30,51,0.055);
}
.panel h2 {
  margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--blue); text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.8px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
}
.panel h2::before {
  content: ""; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue); flex: 0 0 auto;
  box-shadow: var(--glow-blue);
}
.panel h3 { margin: 14px 0 8px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--navy-2); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
.grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
.grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .grid-2, .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
table.data-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12.5px; }
table.data-table th {
  text-align: left; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--blue); padding: 7px 8px;
  font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); cursor: pointer; user-select: none; position: sticky; top: 0;
}
table.data-table th.sortable:hover { background: #e2e8f0; }
table.data-table td { padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eef1f6; vertical-align: top; color: var(--text); }
table.data-table tr:hover td { background: rgba(34,211,238,0.06); }
.pos { color: var(--ok); } .neg { color: var(--red); }
.flag-pill {
  display: inline-block; background: rgba(255,77,94,0.1); color: var(--red); border: 1px solid rgba(255,77,94,0.3);
  border-radius: 3px; font-size: 10.5px; padding: 1px 7px; margin: 1px 2px 1px 0;
}
.flag-pill.review { background: rgba(255,176,32,0.1); color: var(--warn); border-color: rgba(255,176,32,0.35); }
.controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; align-items: center; }
.controls label { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; color: var(--text-muted); display: block; margin-bottom: 3px; }
.controls select, .controls input {
  padding: 6px 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12.5px; min-width: 130px;
  background: #ffffff; color: var(--text);
}
.controls button {
  background: rgba(34,211,238,0.12); color: var(--blue); border: 1px solid var(--blue); border-radius: 4px; padding: 7px 14px;
  font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700;
}
.controls button:hover { background: rgba(34,211,238,0.22); box-shadow: var(--glow-blue); }
.controls button.secondary { background: #f1f5f9; color: var(--navy-2); border-color: var(--border); }
.table-wrap { max-height: 560px; overflow: auto; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 5px; }
.finding-card {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--blue); background: rgba(34,211,238,0.05); padding: 10px 12px;
  border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 12.5px;
}
.finding-card h4 { margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--navy); }
.finding-card .metrics { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11.5px; margin-top: 6px; }
.finding-card.clickable-card { cursor: pointer; }
.finding-card.clickable-card:hover, .finding-card.clickable-card:focus-visible { border-left-color: var(--navy); background: rgba(34,211,238,0.1); }
.small-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 6px; }
.other-callout {
  margin-top: 10px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px dashed var(--border); border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-muted); cursor: pointer;
}
.other-callout:hover { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--navy-2); }
.other-callout strong { color: var(--navy); }
.chip-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 6px 0; }
.chip { background: #f1f5f9; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 3px; padding: 3px 10px; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--navy-2); }
footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11.5px; }

.standout-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.standout-card {
  border: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 3px solid var(--nasa-blue); border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 13px 15px; background: var(--panel); box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(15,30,51,0.06);
  transition: box-shadow 0.15s ease;
}
.standout-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(15,30,51,0.1); }
.standout-card .sc-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.standout-card .sc-name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); font-size: 13.5px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }

.standout-card .sc-amount {
  font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Consolas, monospace; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue);
  font-size: 13px; white-space: nowrap; text-shadow: var(--glow-blue);
}
.standout-card .sc-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px; }
.reason-tag {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 8px; margin: 0 4px 4px 0; border: 1px solid transparent;
}
.reason-tag.high_concentration { background: rgba(34,211,238,0.1); color: var(--nasa-blue); border-color: rgba(34,211,238,0.3); }
.reason-tag.deobligation_flag { background: rgba(255,77,94,0.1); color: var(--red); border-color: rgba(255,77,94,0.3); }
.reason-tag.rapid_growth { background: rgba(43,255,160,0.1); color: var(--ok); border-color: rgba(43,255,160,0.3); }
.reason-tag.rapid_decline { background: rgba(255,176,32,0.1); color: var(--warn); border-color: rgba(255,176,32,0.3); }
.standout-card .sc-reason-detail { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text); margin: 4px 0 8px; }
.standout-card .sc-reason-detail:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 10px; }
.sc-details { display: none; }
.sc-details.expanded { display: block; }
.sc-details-toggle {
  background: none; border: none; color: var(--blue); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer; padding: 2px 0; margin-bottom: 6px; text-decoration: underline;
}
.award-desc-short { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 4px 0 6px; }
.sc-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }

tr.jump-row { cursor: pointer; }
tr.jump-row:hover td { background: rgba(34,211,238,0.08); }
tr.jump-row td:first-child { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600; }
.jump-cta {
  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(34,211,238,0.08), rgba(34,211,238,0.02));
  border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.3); border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 10px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--navy-2);
}
.jump-cta button {
  background: rgba(34,211,238,0.15); color: var(--blue); border: 1px solid var(--blue); border-radius: 4px; padding: 7px 14px;
  font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
}
.jump-cta button:hover { background: rgba(34,211,238,0.25); box-shadow: var(--glow-blue); }
@keyframes flash-highlight-anim {
  0%, 100% { box-shadow: none; }
  25%, 75% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--blue), var(--glow-blue); }
}
.flash-highlight { animation: flash-highlight-anim 1.4s ease-in-out; }
.sc-actions button {
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  border-radius: 4px; padding: 5px 9px; cursor: pointer;
  border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #ffffff; color: var(--navy-2);
}
.sc-actions button.primary { background: rgba(34,211,238,0.15); color: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue); }
.sc-actions button.flag-btn.marked { background: rgba(255,176,32,0.12); color: var(--warn); border-color: var(--warn); }
.sc-actions button:hover { filter: brightness(0.97); }

.award-card { border-left-color: var(--nasa-red); }
.award-head-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; }
.award-icon {
  flex: 0 0 auto; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(34,211,238,0.08);
  border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.25);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
}
.award-head-text { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
.award-category { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--navy-2); margin: 1px 0 2px; }
/* Codes/IDs (award IDs, PSC, NAICS, mod numbers) are reference data, not the
   headline -- rendered smaller, monospaced, and muted so names/categories/
   amounts read first. */
.code-text { font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Consolas, monospace; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--text-muted); letter-spacing: 0.1px; }
.award-id { font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); }
.award-desc {
  font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text); font-style: italic; background: rgba(34,211,238,0.05);
  border-radius: 5px; padding: 7px 9px; margin: 6px 0 8px; max-height: 74px; overflow: auto;
}
.reason-tag.high_value { background: rgba(34,211,238,0.1); color: var(--nasa-blue); border-color: rgba(34,211,238,0.3); }
.reason-tag.cost_growth { background: rgba(255,176,32,0.1); color: var(--warn); border-color: rgba(255,176,32,0.3); }

/* "New since last run" -- snapshot-diffed items get a small badge next to
   the amount so a repeat viewer can tell what changed without re-reading
   every card. */
.new-badge {
  display: inline-block; background: var(--ok); color: #fff; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 800;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; border-radius: 3px; padding: 1px 6px;
  margin-left: 6px; vertical-align: middle; box-shadow: var(--glow-green);
}
.duplicate-pair-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text); margin: 4px 0; }
.duplicate-pair-row .code-text { display: block; }

/* Keyboard accessibility: every interactive element gets a visible focus
   ring on keyboard nav (not on mouse click, via :focus-visible) -- a
   dashboard is not "interactive" if it only works with a mouse. */
button:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, a:focus-visible,
tr.jump-row:focus-visible, .duplicate-pair-row:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--blue); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 2px;
}

/* Theme toggle */
.theme-toggle {
  background: rgba(34,211,238,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.35); color: #22d3ee;
  border-radius: 4px; padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.4px; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
}
.theme-toggle:hover { background: rgba(34,211,238,0.2); }

/* Command palette (Ctrl/Cmd+K) */
.cmdk-trigger {
  background: rgba(34,211,238,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.25); color: #7fa8c4;
  border-radius: 4px; padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 11px; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
  font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Consolas, monospace;
}
.cmdk-trigger:hover { background: rgba(34,211,238,0.14); }

.sr-only {
  position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden;
  clip: rect(0,0,0,0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0;
}

/* Global Timeframe control -- header FY-from/FY-to range that scopes
   Executive Overview, Year-over-Year Trends, Transaction Explorer, Supplier
   Analysis, and Categories & Opportunities to a fiscal-year range (both
   ends default to the full embedded range, equivalent to "All Years").
   Styled to sit alongside the other header buttons. */
.header-timeframe {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; background: rgba(34,211,238,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.25); border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 10px;
}
.header-timeframe label {
  font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: #7fa8c4; white-space: nowrap;
}
.header-timeframe-sep { font-size: 10px; color: #7fa8c4; }
.header-timeframe select {
  background: transparent; border: none; color: #e8f7ff; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700;
  cursor: pointer; padding: 1px 2px; max-width: 72px;
}
.header-timeframe select:focus { outline: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.5); }
.header-timeframe select option { background: #0a1424; color: #e8f7ff; }
.cmdk-overlay {
  display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(5,7,12,0.55); z-index: 200;
  align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; padding-top: 12vh;
}
.cmdk-overlay.open { display: flex; }
.cmdk-box {
  background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; width: min(600px, 90vw);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); overflow: hidden;
}
.cmdk-input {
  width: 100%; border: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 14px 16px; font-size: 14px;
  background: var(--panel); color: var(--text); outline: none;
}
.cmdk-results { max-height: 50vh; overflow-y: auto; }
.cmdk-item {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 16px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-2);
}
.cmdk-item.active { background: rgba(8,145,178,0.1); }
.cmdk-item .cmdk-type {
  font-size: 9.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue);
  background: rgba(8,145,178,0.1); border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 6px; flex: 0 0 auto;
}
.cmdk-empty { padding: 20px 16px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; }
.cmdk-hint { padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--text-muted); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
.cmdk-hint kbd {
  font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; background: var(--panel-2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 5px; font-size: 10px;
}

/* KPI drill-down modal -- "how does this number build up?" */
.kpi-modal-overlay {
  display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(5,7,12,0.55); z-index: 210;
  align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; padding-top: 8vh;
}
.kpi-modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }
.kpi-modal-box {
  background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; width: min(680px, 92vw);
  max-height: 80vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); overflow: hidden;
}
.kpi-modal-header {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 14px 18px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); flex: 0 0 auto;
}
.kpi-modal-header h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--navy); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; }
.kpi-modal-close {
  background: none; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; color: var(--text-muted);
  cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; padding: 3px 9px; line-height: 1.4;
}
.kpi-modal-close:hover { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); }
.kpi-modal-formula {
  padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text); background: rgba(8,145,178,0.05);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); flex: 0 0 auto; line-height: 1.5;
}
.kpi-modal-note { padding: 8px 18px 0 18px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); flex: 0 0 auto; }
.kpi-modal-table-wrap { overflow-y: auto; padding: 8px 18px 18px 18px; flex: 1 1 auto; }
.kpi-modal-table-wrap table.data-table td, .kpi-modal-table-wrap table.data-table th { font-size: 12px; }

/* ---------------- Action Center: mitigation-workflow tracker ----------------
   Demonstration-only: every bit of state here (which step a workflow is on,
   its notes, its status) lives in this browser's localStorage. Nothing is
   sent anywhere, and nothing here executes a real contracting action --
   it's a visual model of what a workflow tracker for these signals could
   look like, not a connection to one. */
.wf-disclosure {
  font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); background: rgba(217,119,6,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(217,119,6,0.3); border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 14px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.5;
}
.wf-stepper { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 2px 14px 2px; }
.wf-step { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; flex: 0 0 auto; width: 132px; text-align: center; }
.wf-step-dot {
  width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; border: 2px solid var(--border); color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--panel);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}
.wf-step.active .wf-step-dot { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); box-shadow: var(--glow-blue); }
.wf-step.done .wf-step-dot { border-color: #16a34a; background: #16a34a; color: #fff; }
.wf-step-label { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0 4px; }
.wf-step.active .wf-step-label { color: var(--navy); font-weight: 700; }
.wf-step.done .wf-step-label { color: #16a34a; }
.wf-step-connector { flex: 1 1 auto; height: 2px; background: var(--border); margin: 13px -4px 0 -4px; min-width: 20px; }
.wf-step-connector.done { background: #16a34a; }
/* Compact variant for list/card contexts -- dots only, no labels. */
.wf-mini-stepper { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px; margin: 6px 0; }
.wf-mini-stepper .wf-mini-dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--border); flex: 0 0 auto; }
.wf-mini-stepper .wf-mini-dot.done { background: #16a34a; }
.wf-mini-stepper .wf-mini-dot.active { background: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(8,145,178,0.18); }
.wf-status-badge {
  display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 8px;
}
.wf-status-badge.not_started { background: rgba(100,116,139,0.12); color: var(--text-muted); }
.wf-status-badge.in_progress { background: rgba(8,145,178,0.12); color: var(--blue); }
.wf-status-badge.complete { background: rgba(22,163,74,0.12); color: #16a34a; }
.wf-action-card {
  border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 13px 15px; background: var(--panel);
  box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(15,30,51,0.06); margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.wf-action-card .wf-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.wf-action-card .wf-name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); font-size: 13.5px; }
.wf-action-card .wf-playbook-name { font-size: 12px; color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600; margin-top: 2px; }
.wf-priority-negative { border-left: 3px solid var(--nasa-red); }
.wf-modal-overlay {
  display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(5,7,12,0.55); z-index: 220;
  align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; padding-top: 6vh;
}
.wf-modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }
.wf-modal-box {
  background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; width: min(720px, 94vw);
  max-height: 88vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); overflow: hidden;
}
.wf-modal-header { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; padding: 14px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); flex: 0 0 auto; }
.wf-modal-header h3 { margin: 0 0 3px 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--navy); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; }
.wf-modal-meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); }
.wf-modal-body { overflow-y: auto; padding: 6px 18px 18px 18px; flex: 1 1 auto; }
.wf-current-step {
  background: rgba(8,145,178,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(8,145,178,0.25); border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--navy); margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.5;
}
.wf-modal-body textarea {
  width: 100%; min-height: 70px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px;
  font-family: inherit; font-size: 12.5px; resize: vertical; color: var(--text); background: var(--panel);
}
.wf-modal-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; }
.wf-tab-note { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-muted); margin: -4px 0 12px 0; }

/* Toast notifications */
#toast-container { position: fixed; bottom: 20px; right: 20px; z-index: 300; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
.toast {
  background: var(--navy); color: var(--panel); padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12.5px;
  font-weight: 600; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px);
  transition: opacity 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease; max-width: 320px;
}
.toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

/* Sortable Top Suppliers/Contracts headers (complements the "Top by" select) */
table.data-table th.col-sortable { position: relative; padding-right: 18px; }
table.data-table th.col-sortable::after { content: "⇅"; position: absolute; right: 6px; opacity: 0.35; font-size: 10px; }
table.data-table th.col-sortable.sort-asc::after { content: "▲"; opacity: 1; color: var(--blue); }
table.data-table th.col-sortable.sort-desc::after { content: "▼"; opacity: 1; color: var(--blue); }

/* Subtle entrance animation when a tab becomes active -- signals "this is
   fresh," not just an instant show/hide toggle. */
@keyframes tab-fade-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
.tab-panel.active { animation: tab-fade-in 0.25s ease; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="top">
  <div class="header-row">
    <div class="nasa-mark" title="Stylized mark -- not the official NASA insignia">
      <svg width="46" height="46" viewBox="0 0 46 46" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <circle cx="23" cy="23" r="21" fill="#0a1424" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <ellipse cx="23" cy="23" rx="19" ry="7" fill="none" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.6"/>
        <ellipse cx="23" cy="23" rx="19" ry="7" fill="none" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.6" transform="rotate(60 23 23)"/>
        <ellipse cx="23" cy="23" rx="19" ry="7" fill="none" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.6" transform="rotate(120 23 23)"/>
        <path d="M23 10 C 25 16, 25 30, 23 36 C 21 30, 21 16, 23 10 Z" fill="#ff5b3d"/>
        <circle cx="23" cy="23" r="2.6" fill="#e8f7ff"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="header-title-block">
      <div class="title-line">
        <h1 id="dash-title">NASA Procurement Intelligence Dashboard</h1>
        <span class="nasa-wordmark">NASA</span>
        <span class="unofficial-badge">Unofficial · Not NASA-affiliated</span>
      </div>
      <div class="disclosure" id="dash-disclosure"></div>
      <div class="meta-bar" id="meta-bar"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex:0 0 auto; align-self:flex-start; align-items:center;">
      <div class="header-timeframe" title="Scope Executive Overview, Year-over-Year Trends, Transaction Explorer, Supplier Analysis, and Categories to a fiscal-year range">
        <label for="global-timeframe-from">FY</label>
        <select id="global-timeframe-from"></select>
        <span class="header-timeframe-sep">to</span>
        <label for="global-timeframe-to" class="sr-only">to FY</label>
        <select id="global-timeframe-to"></select>
      </div>
      <button class="cmdk-trigger" id="cmdk-trigger" title="Search suppliers, awards, categories, tabs">🔍 Search <kbd style="margin-left:4px;">Ctrl K</kbd></button>
      <button class="theme-toggle" id="theme-toggle-btn"></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="cmdk-overlay" id="cmdk-overlay">
  <div class="cmdk-box">
    <input class="cmdk-input" id="cmdk-input" type="text" placeholder="Jump to a supplier, award, category, or tab…" autocomplete="off">
    <div class="cmdk-results" id="cmdk-results"></div>
    <div class="cmdk-hint"><kbd>↑</kbd> <kbd>↓</kbd> to navigate · <kbd>Enter</kbd> to jump · <kbd>Esc</kbd> to close</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="kpi-modal-overlay" id="kpi-modal-overlay">
  <div class="kpi-modal-box">
    <div class="kpi-modal-header">
      <h3 id="kpi-modal-title"></h3>
      <button class="kpi-modal-close" id="kpi-modal-close">✕ Close</button>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-modal-formula" id="kpi-modal-formula"></div>
    <div class="kpi-modal-note" id="kpi-modal-note"></div>
    <div class="kpi-modal-table-wrap" id="kpi-modal-table-wrap"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<nav class="tabs">
  <button data-tab="overview" class="active">Executive Overview</button>
  <button data-tab="highlights">Standout Suppliers &amp; Contracts</button>
  <button data-tab="yoy">Year-over-Year Trends</button>
  <button data-tab="explorer">Transaction Explorer</button>
  <button data-tab="supplier">Supplier Analysis</button>
  <button data-tab="categories">Categories &amp; Opportunities</button>
  <button data-tab="actions">🎯 Action Center</button>
</nav>

<main>

  <!-- ================= TAB 1: EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW ================= -->
  <section id="tab-overview" class="tab-panel active">
    <div id="overview-warning"></div>
    <div class="small-note" id="overview-kpi-scope-note" style="display:none;"></div>
    <div class="kpi-row" id="overview-kpis"></div>
    <div class="jump-cta" id="overview-jump-cta"></div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="panel"><h2 id="trend-chart-title">Annual Obligation Trend</h2><div class="small-note" id="trend-chart-note" style="margin-bottom:4px; display:none;"></div><div id="chart-annual-trend" style="height:280px;"></div></div>
      <div class="panel"><h2>Category Composition (Net Obligations)</h2><div class="small-note" style="margin-bottom:4px;">Click a bar to jump to that category. "Other or Unclassified" is shown separately below -- it's a review queue, not a spend category.</div><div id="chart-category-comp" style="height:264px;"></div><div id="category-other-callout"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Top Suppliers</h2>
        <div class="controls" style="margin-bottom:6px;">
          <div>
            <label>"Top" by</label>
            <select id="top-suppliers-sort">
              <option value="net_obligations">Net obligations ($)</option>
              <option value="transaction_count">Transaction count</option>
              <option value="unique_awards">Number of awards</option>
              <option value="deobligations">Deobligations ($)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="small-note">Click a row to jump to that supplier's full analysis. Always all-time across every embedded year, regardless of the header's Timeframe selector.</div>
        <div class="table-wrap" style="max-height:300px;"><table class="data-table" id="table-top-suppliers"></table></div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Top Contracts</h2>
        <div class="controls" style="margin-bottom:6px;">
          <div>
            <label>"Top" by</label>
            <select id="top-contracts-sort">
              <option value="net_obligations">Net obligations ($)</option>
              <option value="transaction_count">Transaction count</option>
              <option value="modification_count">Modification count</option>
              <option value="deobligations">Deobligations ($)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="small-note">Ranked from up to the 300 largest-value awards in this dataset. Click a row to jump to it (Standouts tab if flagged there, otherwise the Transaction Explorer). Always all-time across every embedded year, regardless of the header's Timeframe selector.</div>
        <div class="table-wrap" style="max-height:300px;"><table class="data-table" id="table-top-contracts"></table></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Key Findings</h2>
      <div id="overview-findings"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= TAB 1B: HIGHLIGHTS (Standout Suppliers & Contracts) ================= -->
  <section id="tab-highlights" class="tab-panel">
    <div id="snapshot-status" class="small-note" style="margin-bottom:4px;"></div>
    <div id="standouts-scope-note" class="small-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;"></div>
    <div class="grid-2-even">
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Standout Suppliers</h2>
        <div class="small-note">
          Up to 5 suppliers, surfaced by disclosed signals -- not a performance rating. Click "Details" on a card for the supporting metric.
        </div>
        <div class="standout-grid" id="standout-suppliers" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Top Contracts &amp; Awards</h2>
        <div class="small-note">
          Up to 5 awards, surfaced by value and by disclosed signals -- not a cost-overrun finding. Icons are illustrative category icons, not product photos.
          <button class="sc-details-toggle" id="award-photo-note-toggle" style="margin-left:4px;">Why no real photos?</button>
          <div class="sc-details" id="award-photo-note">
            This dashboard is self-contained and works fully offline (no network call at view
            time), and this build environment's outbound network access is blocked, so no image
            could be fetched and verified at generation time either -- the category icons are
            generated locally, not pulled from the web.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="standout-grid" id="standout-awards" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2-even" style="margin-top:16px;">
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Consolidation Opportunities</h2>
        <div class="small-note">
          Categories where spend is split across several suppliers with no dominant one --
          a fragmentation signal, not a recommended vendor and not a savings estimate (no
          per-vendor unit-price data available to compute one).
        </div>
        <div class="standout-grid" id="consolidation-opportunities" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Possible Duplicate Purchases</h2>
        <div class="small-note">
          Pairs of separate awards -- same supplier, same category, similar dollar amount,
          close together in time -- that might reflect one need bought twice rather than
          consolidated once. Not evidence of waste on its own.
        </div>
        <div class="standout-grid" id="duplicate-candidates" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= TAB 2: YEAR-OVER-YEAR TRENDS ================= -->
  <section id="tab-yoy" class="tab-panel">
    <div id="yoy-warning"></div>
    <div class="small-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Compare range is set by the header's Timeframe control (top of page).</div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="panel"><h2>Net &amp; Gross Obligations by Fiscal Year</h2><div id="chart-yoy-obligations" style="height:300px;"></div></div>
      <div class="panel"><h2>Deobligations by Fiscal Year</h2><div id="chart-yoy-deob" style="height:300px;"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="panel"><h2>Supplier &amp; Award Counts</h2><div id="chart-yoy-counts" style="height:300px;"></div></div>
      <div class="panel"><h2>Supplier Concentration Trend (HHI &amp; Top-5 Share)</h2><div id="chart-yoy-concentration" style="height:300px;"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel"><h2>Category Trends (Top Categories)</h2><div id="chart-yoy-category" style="height:340px;"></div></div>
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>FY Comparison Table</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table" id="table-yoy"></table></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= TAB 3: TRANSACTION EXPLORER ================= -->
  <section id="tab-explorer" class="tab-panel">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="small-note" id="explorer-disclosure"></div>
      <div class="small-note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Fiscal-year range is set by the header's Timeframe control (top of page); everything below is a local refinement of it.</div>
      <div class="controls">
        <div><label>Search</label><input id="ex-search" type="text" placeholder="supplier, award ID, description..."></div>
        <div><label>Supplier</label><select id="ex-supplier"><option value="">All</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Category</label><select id="ex-category"><option value="">All</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Direction</label><select id="ex-direction"><option value="">All</option><option>OBLIGATION</option><option>DEOBLIGATION</option><option>ZERO_DOLLAR_ACTION</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Min. Confidence</label><input id="ex-confidence" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0"></div>
        <div><label>Min. |Amount| ($)</label><input id="ex-amount" type="number" min="0" step="1000" value="0"></div>
        <div style="align-self:flex-end;"><button id="ex-export">Export filtered CSV</button></div>
        <div style="align-self:flex-end;"><button id="ex-reset" class="secondary">Reset filters</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="small-note" id="explorer-count"></div>
      <div class="small-note" id="explorer-timeframe-note"></div>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table" id="table-explorer"></table></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= TAB 4: SUPPLIER ANALYSIS ================= -->
  <section id="tab-supplier" class="tab-panel">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="controls">
        <div style="min-width:280px;"><label>Select supplier</label><select id="supplier-select"></select></div>
      </div>
      <div id="supplier-headline" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:14px;"></div>
      <div class="small-note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">KPI tiles below are always all-time for this supplier. The header's Timeframe control highlights the matching fiscal year(s) in the Annual Net Obligations chart instead.</div>
      <div class="kpi-row" id="supplier-kpis"></div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div><h3>Annual Net Obligations</h3><div id="chart-supplier-annual" style="height:260px;"></div></div>
        <div><h3>Category Mix</h3><div id="chart-supplier-category" style="height:260px;"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div>
          <h3>Raw Name Variants Consolidated</h3>
          <div class="chip-row" id="supplier-variants"></div>
          <h3>Resolution Evidence</h3>
          <div id="supplier-evidence" class="small-note"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>NASA Awarding Offices</h3>
          <div class="chip-row" id="supplier-offices"></div>
          <h3>Flags</h3>
          <div id="supplier-flags"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= TAB 5: CATEGORIES & OPPORTUNITIES ================= -->
  <section id="tab-categories" class="tab-panel">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="controls">
        <div style="min-width:280px;"><label>Select category</label><select id="category-select"></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="small-note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">KPI tiles below are always all-time for this category. The header's Timeframe control highlights the matching fiscal year(s) in the Annual Trend chart instead.</div>
      <div class="kpi-row" id="category-kpis"></div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div><h3>Annual Trend</h3><div id="chart-category-annual" style="height:260px;"></div></div>
        <div>
          <h3>Leading Suppliers</h3>
          <div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table" id="table-category-suppliers"></table></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2>Grounded AI Insights (this category)</h2>
      <div id="category-findings"></div>
      <h2>Data Quality Summary</h2>
      <div class="kpi-row" id="category-quality-kpis"></div>
      <h2>Low-Confidence Review Queue</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table" id="table-review-queue"></table></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= TAB 6: ACTION CENTER ================= -->
  <section id="tab-actions" class="tab-panel">
    <div class="wf-disclosure">
      ⚠ <strong>Demonstration workflow tracker.</strong> Everything below (which step a workflow is on, its notes,
      its status) is saved to this browser's localStorage only. Nothing is sent to NASA, a contracting system, or
      any external service, and nothing here executes a real contracting action -- this models what a
      mitigation-tracking tool for these signals could look like, for demonstration purposes.
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Playbook Library</h2>
      <div class="small-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Reference workflows this dashboard suggests for each disclosed signal type -- click a card to see its full step sequence.</div>
      <div id="playbook-library" class="grid-2-even"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Suggested Actions</h2>
      <div class="small-note" id="suggested-actions-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;"></div>
      <div id="suggested-actions"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Active Workflows</h2>
      <div class="controls" style="margin-bottom:6px;">
        <div><label>Status</label><select id="wf-status-filter"><option value="">All</option><option value="in_progress">In progress</option><option value="complete">Complete</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <div id="active-workflows"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<div class="wf-modal-overlay" id="wf-modal-overlay">
  <div class="wf-modal-box">
    <div class="wf-modal-header">
      <div>
        <h3 id="wf-modal-title"></h3>
        <div class="wf-modal-meta" id="wf-modal-meta"></div>
      </div>
      <button class="kpi-modal-close" id="wf-modal-close">✕ Close</button>
    </div>
    <div class="wf-modal-body">
      <div id="wf-modal-stepper"></div>
      <div class="wf-current-step" id="wf-modal-current-step"></div>
      <label class="small-note" for="wf-modal-notes" style="display:block; margin-bottom:4px;">Notes (saved locally)</label>
      <textarea id="wf-modal-notes" placeholder="Optional notes about this workflow..."></textarea>
      <div class="wf-modal-actions" id="wf-modal-actions"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

